            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo l 4 x 16 Pull Plate And Push Plate Set with 2-1/8\" Bore Hole</b>\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size 4\" x 16\" commercial door pull plate with 8-3/4\" pull handle and 4\" x 16\" push plate. Predrilled with a 2-1/8\" bore hole.  Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, factories and stores. Made in the USA from .050\" thick solid brass or solid bronze.  Packaged with mounting harware for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Don-Jo  Commercial Pull Plate And Push Plate Set\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Height: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish:   <b>Polished Brass</b> </li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold As A Set One Pull Plate with Handle and One Push Plate.</b> \r\n</p>",
